source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A list item's content start forms no list marker: a bare marker run there stays item text, unlike the line controls Jira does read at that position.
-- input.jira --
* * item
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>* item</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- \* item
-- warnings.json --
[]
